    <string name="dialog_message">Tenno,\n\nThe Tenno Element Synthesizer allows you to combine two basic elemental damage types into a more powerful secondary element.\n\n─ HOW TO USE ─\n\n1. Tap any two element buttons to load them into the Mod Slots.\n\n2. Each slot accepts exactly one element. You cannot load the same element twice.\n\n3. Press SYNTHESIZE to calculate the resulting combined damage type.\n\n4. Press CLEAR at any time to reset both slots and start over.\n\n─ KNOWN COMBINATIONS ─\n\nHeat + Cold         →  Blast\nHeat + Toxin        →  Gas\nHeat + Electricity  →  Radiation\nCold + Toxin        →  Viral\nCold + Electricity  →  Magnetic\nToxin + Electricity →  Corrosive\n\nGood hunting, Tenno. The Origin System needs you.</string>
